      "System.CreatedDate": "2026-09-07T14:41:46.653Z",
      "System.Description": "<p>Keep the purchase journey dependable beyond the payment step: order confirmations, invoice delivery, and post-purchase communication must meet the same reliability bar as checkout itself. Covers the confirmation-email pipeline (delivery, retry, audit) and invoice rendering/attachment for completed orders. Success is measured via confirmation delivery rate and post-purchase support tickets, complementing the epic's checkout-conversion goal. </p>",
